  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Calamity Beckoning Immortal Gu’s food is the black blood of the desolate beast six headed snake. The six headed snake is a desolate beast hard to come by, with strength equivalent to Gu Immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        672
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "food-for-calamity-beckoning",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_calamity_beckoning_gu",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s list for Tai Bai Yun Sheng includes the blood of the desolate beast six headed snake among Immortal Gu foods to seek around Hai Shi blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        673
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shopping-list",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "loc_hai_shi_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When a six headed snake carcass is sold in pieces in treasure yellow heaven, the seller has skin, flesh, bones, eyes, and snake tendons, but no blood. The snake had already been dead for close to a hundred years, so the black blood had completely seeped out.",
      "chapters": [
        682
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "missing-from-a-carcass",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After the six headed snake’s large skeleton melts in Hu Immortal blessed land’s blood pool, Fang Yuan obtains a great amount of black blood and feeds that blood to Calamity Beckoning Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        683
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "extracted-and-fed",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The six headed snake’s bones turn into black blood and are fed to Calamity Beckoning Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        709
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bones-turned-to-blood",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan has already fed Calamity Beckoning Gu with the black blood of the six headed snake. The six headed snake is a desolate beast with six heads; for a long term plan he intends to move several into his immortal aperture to breed them.",
      "chapters": [
        1083
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "breeding-plan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
